{"id":"u41","kelas":11,"no":7,"judul":"Rangkuman Kelas 11","title":"Review Kelas 11","emoji":"🎓","ringkas":"Latihan campuran semua materi kelas 11","ready":true,"goals":["mengulang ungkapan **berpendapat**, setuju, dan tidak setuju","membedakan **analytical exposition** dan **hortatory exposition**","mengulang **explanation text** dan **news item**","mengulang **application letter** dan **CV**","mengerjakan **latihan campuran** dari seluruh materi Kelas 11"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Ini unit terakhir Kelas 11. Kamu **mengulang semuanya**: berpendapat, dua jenis eksposisi, teks eksplanasi, berita, serta surat lamaran dan CV. Baca rangkuman di bawah, lalu kerjakan Latihan dan Kuis."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Rangkuman jenis teks","table":[["Jenis teks","Tujuan","Struktur","Ciri bahasa"],["**Analytical exposition**","meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu memang demikian","Thesis, Arguments, Reiteration","simple present, firstly/therefore"],["**Hortatory exposition**","meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu seharusnya dilakukan","Thesis, Arguments, Recommendation","should/must, Let's, I suggest that"],["**Explanation**","menjelaskan proses (how/why)","General Statement, Sequenced Explanation","simple present, passive, first/then/so"],["**News item**","memberitakan peristiwa penting","Headline, Newsworthy Event, Background Events, Sources","simple past, passive, said/according to"],["**Application letter**","melamar pekerjaan","heading, salutation, opening, body, closing","bahasa formal, I am writing to apply ..."]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Ungkapan berpendapat","table":[["Fungsi","Ungkapan"],["Bertanya","[[What do you think about ...?]]"],["Berpendapat","[[In my opinion, ...]] / [[I believe that ...]]"],["Setuju","[[I totally agree.]] / [[That's true.]]"],["Setuju sebagian","[[You have a point, but ...]]"],["Tidak setuju sopan","[[I'm afraid I disagree.]] / [[I see your point, but ...]]"],["Kontras","[[but]], [[however]], [[although]], [[on the other hand]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Kata penghubung penting","table":[["Fungsi","Kata"],["Urutan","[[firstly]], [[secondly]], [[first]], [[then]], [[next]], [[finally]]"],["Tambahan","[[moreover]], [[besides]], [[furthermore]]"],["Sebab","[[because]], [[since]], [[due to]]"],["Akibat","[[so]], [[therefore]], [[as a result]], [[consequently]]"],["Kesimpulan","[[in conclusion]], [[to sum up]]"],["Sumber","[[according to]], [[said]], [[reported]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Modal dan passive","table":[["Topik","Ingat"],["**should / ought to**","saran: [[We should save water.]]"],["**must / must not**","wajib dan larangan: [[You must not litter.]]"],["**had better**","sebaiknya: [[You had better hurry.]]"],["**Passive present**","is/are + V3: [[Clouds are formed in the sky.]]"],["**Passive past**","was/were + V3: [[Three houses were destroyed.]]"],["**suggest that**","diikuti kata kerja dasar: [[I suggest that he study.]]"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Cara membedakan jenis teks","text":"Lihat **kalimat penutup** dan **tujuan**. Berakhir dengan saran atau ajakan → *hortatory*. Menegaskan ulang pendapat → *analytical*. Menjelaskan proses berurutan → *explanation*. Ada kutipan dan 5W+1H → *news item*. Ada *Dear Sir or Madam* → *application letter*."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mengulang pelajaran","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Class, which text ends with a recommendation?","id":"Anak-anak, teks mana yang diakhiri dengan rekomendasi?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"Hortatory exposition. It tells us what we should do.","id":"Hortatory exposition. Teks itu memberi tahu apa yang seharusnya kita lakukan."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. And which text explains how rain is formed?","id":"Bagus. Dan teks mana yang menjelaskan bagaimana hujan terbentuk?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"An explanation text. It uses first, then, and finally.","id":"Teks eksplanasi. Teks itu memakai first, then, dan finally."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["**Analytical** meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu demikian; **hortatory** mengajak bertindak.","**Explanation** menjelaskan proses; **news item** memberitakan peristiwa dengan 5W + 1H.","**Application letter** memakai bahasa formal; salam dan penutup harus serasi.","Selamat, Kelas 11 selesai! 🎉"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan tujuannya:","pairs":[["analytical exposition","meyakinkan bahwa sesuatu demikian"],["hortatory exposition","mengajak bertindak"],["explanation","menjelaskan proses"],["news item","memberitakan peristiwa"]],"exp":"Tujuan tiap jenis teks.","k":"01bae8f5"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan strukturnya:","pairs":[["analytical","Thesis, Arguments, Reiteration"],["hortatory","Thesis, Arguments, Recommendation"],["news item","Headline, Newsworthy Event, Background Events"],["explanation","General Statement, Sequenced Explanation"]],"exp":"Struktur tiap jenis teks.","k":"75f8041a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang diakhiri \"Therefore, let's save water.\" adalah...","options":["hortatory exposition","analytical exposition","news item","recount"],"answer":0,"exp":"Ajakan bertindak = hortatory.","k":"0d59a7bc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang menjelaskan bagaimana pelangi terbentuk adalah...","options":["explanation","hortatory","application letter","invitation"],"answer":0,"exp":"Menjelaskan proses alam.","k":"2e588848"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang memuat headline dan kutipan saksi adalah...","options":["news item","explanation","procedure","narrative"],"answer":0,"exp":"Ciri berita.","k":"6f5099da"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang diawali \"Dear Sir or Madam\" dan \"I am writing to apply\" adalah...","options":["application letter","news item","explanation","hortatory"],"answer":0,"exp":"Surat lamaran.","k":"2cbfac27"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang dominan pada news item adalah...","options":["simple past","simple present","future","present perfect continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"Peristiwa sudah terjadi.","k":"a1df554b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang dominan pada explanation text adalah...","options":["simple present","si